The plate holds 7 sushi rolls (futomaki-style, with salmon, shrimp, avocado and cucumber). Each piece is roughly 35–40 g, so about 260 g in total. At about 1.5 kcal/g, that comes to roughly 390 kcal.

The question asks about "everything on the plate," and the plate itself has only the sushi. The soup, drink and sauces are on the tray, not the plate, so I left them out.

{"kcal": 390, "mass_g": 260}
